These defaults apply to Transient menus@comma{} including Magit@comma{} only where the menu
has no binding of its own. The menu overview lists the available review keys.
While reviewing a menu@comma{} @kbd{C-e} means the end of the item: it is not the ordinary
Emacsvox speech prefix. Use @kbd{C-c l}@comma{} @kbd{C-c w} and @kbd{C-c c} for these menu repeats.
After closing the menu@comma{} ordinary buffer bindings apply again.

@item
@anchor{Choose navigation and announcement preferences}Choose navigation and announcement preferences


