Choose @kbd{m} for @emph{By movement: sections or items}. Left/right speaks only the
destination section and its position. Up/down speaks only the item@comma{} key@comma{} and
relevant value@comma{} even when Continuous navigation crosses a section boundary.
Section-change and wrapping earcons remain the same. This option applies to
