@code{make compiled-aural-test} on both versions with a private home directory.
It covers speech@comma{} voice configuration@comma{} transport@comma{} Voice Workbench@comma{} startup@comma{}
and golden speech traces without optional Emacs packages.  It requires GNU
Make@comma{} Git@comma{} a POSIX shell@comma{} and Tcl (@code{tclsh}); missing prerequisites fail before
the core tests run.  The fresh CI checkout exercises source@comma{} followed by an
isolated compiled Aural check.  Optional integration suites remain outside
this job.

