both versions with a private home directory and eight reviewed dependency
snapshots@comma{} including Transient 0.13.3 and cond-let 1.0.0.  @code{make test-deps} verifies the archive hashes in
@code{test/integration-dependencies.json} and stages sources and autoloads under
