disables speech output and stops its isolated session after 60 seconds.
CI runs both gates on each supported Emacs version.
Pin updates require upstream review@comma{} new archive hashes@comma{}
and fresh preparation for both Emacs versions.  These source tests capture
speech events and exercise disposable EAT subprocesses; they do not replace
listening tests or compiled integration checks.  See @code{test/README.org} for
